    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate blend of old-school roguelike and modern survivors-like action! Dive into retro pixelated dungeons where you control the pace with fast, reactive turn based movement coupled with ever expanding skill combinations to help you plow through hordes of enemies as you delve the world map's multiple dungeons.<br>Perfect for nostalgia seekers and newcomers alike, this game is your gateway to a timeless adventure with a modern twist. Are you ready to survive the dungeon depths and become a legend?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate blend of old-school roguelike and modern survivors-like action! Dive into retro pixelated dungeons where you control the pace with fast, reactive turn based movement coupled with ever expanding skill combinations to help you plow through hordes of enemies as you delve the world map's multiple dungeons.<br>Perfect for nostalgia seekers and newcomers alike, this game is your gateway to a timeless adventure with a modern twist. Are you ready to survive the dungeon depths and become a legend?</p>",
    "short_description": "An old-school roguelike game with modern survivors-like action! Delve into multiple retro pixelated dungeons where you control the pace with fast, reactive turn based movement and ever expanding skills which enable you to plow through hordes of enemies before escaping with the loot",
